        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Dear Villa Elena Manager,\n\nI'm writing to express my extreme disappointment with our recent visit to your restaurant. Despite its beautiful ambiance, the service we received was subpar. Our waitress, Linda, seemed uninterested in attending to our needs. We had to wait an inordinate amount of time for drinks and bread. When we tried to order, she walked away without giving us a chance to finish. We asked her politely to please hold on for the main meals and she told as she was walking away from our table and yelling that the main courses are on their way .. she dumped the main courses while we were still  trying to finish our entrees . She didn’t even pick up the empty dishes . Her attitude was dismissive and unprofessional.\n\nWe were looking forward to a special evening with our children, but the experience fell short.\nGiven the issues we faced, we're surprised no manager was available to address our concerns.We were told someone would call us, but we've yet to hear back.\nUnfortunately we will not be returning .\nHorrible experience from beginning to end!\n\nWe hope you'll take our feedback seriously and take necessary steps to improve your service.\n\nSincerely.",
        "time": 1752625101,
        "translated": false
      }
